# rediseno-proyectos u14: Home's today list leaves out the tasks of the ARCHIVED project Huerto. The seed dates
# "Comprar semillas" (Huerto, archived) and "Repasar el tema 4" (Examen de fisica, active) both today with no time.
# The walk ends on Home; the check then confirms with find-node that "Comprar semillas" is not shown.
# Needs the seed: python .claude/scripts/seed_progress_db.py --device
# Run: python bbadb.py run-steps .claude/skills/adb-ui-test/steps/rp-lifecycle-home.steps --save rp-lifecycle-home
GRANT android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS
START .configuration.SplashActivity
WAIT 5000
TAP id=navigation_home
WAIT 2000
ASSERT id=homeTimerCard
SWIPE 540 1500 540 600 300
WAIT 1200
ASSERT id=homeTasksCard
ASSERT id=homeTodayTaskList
# A row title does nothing on tap (only the check box, focus and remove buttons act): the TAP proves the seeded
# task is listed. Earlier walks leave plain "Repasar" tasks on the emulator, so the row is found by its full title.
TAP text=Repasar el tema 4
WAIT 800
ASSERT id=homeTodayTaskList
SHOT rp-lifecycle-home-today
